    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A small old map from 1668 has helped "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "solve",
            "ref": "v-solve"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a 400-year-old "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "mystery",
            "zh": "谜"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in London. For a long time, people knew that William Shakespeare once owned a house in London, but they did not know where it was."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Now, a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "professor",
            "zh": "教授"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " named Lucy Munro found some old papers while doing "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "research",
            "zh": "研究"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". One of the papers is a simple map of the house. It "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "clearly",
            "ref": "v-clearly"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " shows the shape and rooms of the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "building",
            "ref": "v-building"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The house was in an area called Blackfriars, near the River Thames. It was also close to a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "theatre",
            "ref": "v-theatre"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " where Shakespeare worked and wrote "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "plays",
            "ref": "v-play"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The map was made two years after the Great Fire of London. It gives new information about where Shakespeare lived."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many people used to think Shakespeare left London early. But this "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "discovery",
            "zh": "发现"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " shows he may have stayed in the city longer than people believed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Even though Shakespeare lived hundreds of years ago, this finding helps people learn more about his life and brings history a little closer to us today."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
